OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and rather wet for
OL,6,FOrkney, the rain heavy at times
OL,7,Fthrough the day. Generally drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter for Shetland, but still with
OL,9,Fa little light rain at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain continuing through the
OL,12,Fevening for Orkney but eventually
OL,13,Fturning lighter overnight. Shetland
OL,14,Fwill be mostly cloudy with a few light
OL,15,Fshowers through the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA cool day with northerly
OL,18,Fwinds, some bright weather but
OL,19,Fscattered showers developing for
OL,20,FShetland in the morning and Orkney
OL,21,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
