OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FCooler conditions in northerly winds
OL,7,Fwith scattered showers at times, a lot
OL,8,Fof brighter weather too particularly
OL,9,Ftowards the weekend.
